@crew v-xu-yuki
// Writer 2, batch 8: a short-stay visitor. Mostly not about work.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hello. Xu. Charts. Is that corridor eleven doors or twelve?
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}. Twelve. It was twelve. I've added it to the map.
?

== chat
- I'm mapping the Wren from memory. Deck 4's a maze. A nice one.
- Up early, up late. Charts don't draw themselves. Mostly.   #funny

== near
? deck:2
- The chart room here is better than ours. Don't tell the office.   #funny
? place:mess
- Mess, then the chart room. Same route both ways. Efficient.
?

== bye
- {bye}. If you find a thirteenth door, tell me.   #funny

== smalltalk
- Eleven. Twelve. Twelve.
- That's not on the map. Yet.   #funny
